    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781000/extras/96418ba3a935b6ba11ecf0f21dc88d49.avif?t=1749913952\" width=600 height=338 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An ADV of eternity and changeless, gifting answers from a world that force to move</h2>\u201cLiving in Spring\u201d is a story thinking about two subjects along with an eternal and changeless journey.<br>Follow the story, slowly, and quietly.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6\u25c7\u25c6 Story \u25c6\u25c7\u25c6</h2>\u201cCruel Spring\u201d has come.<br>All human beings have had to keep moving forever.<br><br>If you stop, you become a 'Sacrifice' that will never move. <br>No one can overcome one's fatigue. Then no one would be able to keep being human.<br>But the boy and the girl continue to walk through such a world together.<br><br>Each of them has a body that can move eternally, and a journey goes on forever.<br>It feels like a happy changeless, but the world asks about its eternity.<br><br>Let's go on forever, and to anywhere. <br>Until two answers are gifted to the world...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6\u25c7\u25c6 Characters \u25c6\u25c7\u25c6</h2><strong>- Mion -</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781000/extras/6bd64e456c0f2f6bdb786552843c186e.avif?t=1749913952\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A girl going on the eternal journey together</li></ul><br><strong>- Kanon -</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781000/extras/c1dcac9930947ec5cb4e81dbe3b34754.avif?t=1749913952\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A girl following the eternal journey together</li></ul><br><strong>- Kemel -</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A lead character walking the eternal journey</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6\u25c7\u25c6 Genre \u25c6\u25c7\u25c6</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>An ADV of eternity and changeless</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6\u25c7\u25c6 Contents Info \u25c6\u25c7\u25c6</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The number of end: 1<br></li><li>Story: 3 Main Scenario + Epilogue<br></li><li>Voice: Full Voice in Japanese, without Kemel's one<br></li><li>Event CG: 4 images (1 for each chapter)<br></li><li>CG display mode: available (in Extra mode)</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Story explanation: Japanese Only (after completing epilogue)</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6\u25c7\u25c6 Length \u25c6\u25c7\u25c6</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Main Story: 1-2h<br></li><li>Epilogue: 15-30min</li></ul>",
